  intro pool Ψ m z slots₁ slots₂ lists₁ lists₂ a₁ a₂ W₁ W₂ ω₁ ω₂ Φ G E V B X Y R L
    U density w hG hE hV hB hX hDensity hsep hrows hω₁ hω₂ hcut
  have hn : ∀ x ∈ source,(secondInheritedProfile p x Ψ m z).divisor ≠ 0 ∧
