    m₁ m₂ f slots lists a hslots ha test₁ test₂ W E G₁ G₂ L K hE hG₁ hG₂ hL he₁ he₂ hb₁ hb₂ hs₁ hs₂
  apply (canonicalCubeDualZero_norm_le_of_good p hp hg hinj hc pool b C Ψ₁ Ψ₂ hΨ₁ hΨ₂ m₁ m₂ f _ _ W K).trans
