      (∀ i,∀ P∈lists i,(Ideal.absNorm P:ℝ)≤ H i) → (∏ i,H i)≤ Z^z₀ →
      (∀ f,IsCoprime (Ideal.span {Nlevel}) (G.ideal f)) →
