theorem actual_complete_height_merge (dshort dlong:ℕ)(Z F cstar loss Cs Cb A theta:ℝ)
    (hZ:1≤ Z)(hcstar:0≤ cstar)(hloss:0≤ loss)(hCs:0≤ Cs)(hCb:0≤ Cb)(hA:0≤ A):
